    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "We can rename `clean()` to something else, I wasn't inspired when doing it. \r\n\r\nI really like having this syntax: `__DEV__ && ...` it's so explicit that plugin or option is meant for development environment or not. \r\n\r\nI think we should not bother on how clean is the code for configurations files but on how simple is it to read and to understand.",
