    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Why not do something in between where you split into different categories:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst bundle = __DEV__ ? ...\r\nconst rules = [...];\r\nif (__DEV__) {rules.push()...}\r\nconst plugins = [...];\r\nif (__DEV__) plugins.push(autoreload);\r\n\r\nmodule.exports = {...};\r\n```\r\n\r\nNot ideal but might ease the reading. I was also in favor for production/dev configs but reading this one, it's not that hard to read it (I am used to webpack still)",
